n="Normal commissioning starts when any of the following 4 RE's occur:

cloud bypass turns OFF
power up
heatpump changes mode
midnight pulse

AND current draw is present (CURRENT_MIN_ON_VALUE must be set > fan current draw)


Hourly commissioning starts when the secondsPastMidnightGBL time exceeds one of the 
four start times AND current draw is present AND DAILY_COMMISSIONING_ON is set to 1

The Normal and Hourly commissioning start pulses are OR'd and output"
